WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:12.520
Hi, so we're ready for the third meditation
for the third week of this lam rim

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.760
course.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:21.790
And in the last meditation we had done an
act of truth to send...

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:26.210
actually the whole thing we're trying to send
the virus to the middle of the sun

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.210
right?

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:34.870
And I like to think if our lam rim course
together... if we are successful

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.840
together, then something will happen to the
virus you know?

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:42.449
Maybe we can
contribute to stopping this problem in the

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:45.290
world, and it should be like that
right?

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.850
So let's try.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.590
And we did an act of truth.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.940
Act of truth requires some
ammunition.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.500
Act of truth is like shooting a gun right?

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.089
And you need some kind of
ammunition; you you have to say "if it's true

00:01:00.089 --> 00:01:02.979
I did this, then made this happen."

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:11.880
And we we said if it's true that I've shown
any small kindnesses... ok I've been

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:18.490
reading articles about someone who served
a hundred thousand meals in

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:25.070
hospitals, hooked up all the restaurants to
the hospitals, and served one hundred

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:26.070
thousand meals.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.820
And I read another article about five physicians
from from my

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.140
old university and they're just doing extraordinary
things you know?

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.750
Huge
things that affect thousands and thousands

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.030
of people.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:46.000
But people like you
and me, during this virus... not to go along

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:54.170
with the general fear, not to go
along with the general self-preservation instinct,

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.200
not to go out
and buy all the toilet paper on the first

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.340
day of the virus you know?

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.530
Try to
do small things for other people..

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:04.530
That's our ammunition.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:09.110
So I guess that
means if you haven't done any small things

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:16.260
for other people during this
virus then let's get started.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.260
All right?.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.260
Just small good things.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.190
Encourage
other people, give other people some hope,

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:22.790
share things with other people.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:23.830
You don't
have to...

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.830
I read about a lady who made 30,000 masks
or something okay?

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.970
I'm
not talking about that, I'm talking about

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:38.000
identifying people who are scared, and
who are sad, and who are worried about the

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.580
future, and showing them some basic
human kindness okay?.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.030
So that was our ammunition and then we
did an act of truth: If it's true that during

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:52.390
the 
days of the virus, during the

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:59.440
time of the of the virus, I did this nice
thing to someone else--small

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:06.510
elegant nice thing--then blind people should
start to see, and hungry

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:12.620
people should be given a great meal, and sick
people should get better, people on

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.100
ventilators should all start breathing on
their own.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.580
And even people who are
travelling in their cars, because they can't

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:24.150
go in a plane, they should be safe--
their car should work nice.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:28.210
Children should be safe during this difficult
time..

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:31.700
Elderly people should be safe during
this difficult time.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.170
People have trouble sleeping which is...

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:37.030
I haven't
seen any numbers but it's got to be a huge

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.650
problem right now.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:44.390
Then we did
an act of truth and we sent that to those

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.420
people.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:55.790
Now we're going to do another
act of truth okay?

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.950
This is the third meditation and we're shifting
gears.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:58.950
We're still in the human realm..

00:03:58.950 --> 00:03:59.950
We're still in the world of human beings.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.480
We got out of the hell realms, animal realms,
hungry ghost realms, and we're

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:09.320
still dealing with troubles in this world,
during this virus.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.680
[Master] Shantideva
makes a list okay?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:15.960
So remember where we are--we're going to do
this meditation

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.960
now.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:17.960
We're going to do an act of truth.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:25.650
We're going to think about some, small beautiful,
elegant package of kindness we have delivered

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:26.650
during this
virus.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:33.220
And we're going to make a mental statement
that "if it's true that I have

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:39.600
done this small kind thing then may may the
following things happen."

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.530
And then
there'll be a list of things that we want

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.530
to happen.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.030
So here we go.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:47.560
Get ready
to meditate okay?.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:52.000
Take a drink of water.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:05:06.150
And these meditations
are short, they're designed to be 15 minutes

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.300
only.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:12.510
Something to do once or
twice a day.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:13.810
So we're going to make it very simple.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:18.259
We're going to get into the
meditation with ten breaths.

00:05:18.259 --> 00:05:22.850
(DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB) Here we go.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.570
Long exhales.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:31.060
Keep exhaling
until the lower tummy tightens--which is more

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.840
than you usually exhale.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:51.420
We're
going to do ten long breaths this way--long and fine.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:11.400
Now please think about some small, elegant,
beautiful kindness you have paid

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:18.139
to someone during this difficult time in the
whole world who's afraid, worried

00:07:18.139 --> 00:07:22.910
about the future.

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:28.250
And some small gesture you made to them, but
it should be real.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:32.460
It should be something you really did.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:09.040
And then say to yourself: "let's do an act
of truth: If it's true that during

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:19.440
this frightening time I paid one small kindness
to another person, then the

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.940
following things should happen."

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:28.600
Okay and here's our list from Master Shantideva's
chapter on dedication.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.820
Number one..

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:37.280
People who are having obstacles with
their spiritual practice right?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:42.700
These are deeper obstacles than not having
food or not having clothing okay?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:47.640
At the beginning of this meditation session
we

00:08:47.649 --> 00:08:53.480
showed a photograph of a young woman meditating
and people were making fun of

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.480
her.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:09:02.509
So if it's true that I have paid some kindness,
then may obstacles to

00:09:02.509 --> 00:09:09.910
people's faith, and wisdom, and love--may
these obstacles to their spiritual life

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:13.780
be removed

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.660
in this world.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:40.340
If it's true that I did this one kind thing
during this difficult time, then

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:47.880
may everyone everywhere... and it's humans
everywhere in the universe,

00:09:47.889 --> 00:09:53.680
may they have the freedom to practice their own spiritual path.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.630
May they have this
freedom.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:10:01.060
May they be free from interference in
their private spiritual life

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:04.339
and may they

00:10:04.339 --> 00:10:11.570
be free from divisiveness inside
of spiritual practitioners.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:18.309
May they have... enjoy some kind of unity
and harmony

00:10:18.309 --> 00:10:25.610
within groups of spiritual practitioners,
and in general may they have the freedom

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:29.800
to follow the path they would like to try.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.020
Here Shantideva adds another group of people.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:06.019
These are people who have not
been able to practice well because of physical

00:11:06.019 --> 00:11:07.129
needs.

00:11:07.129 --> 00:11:11.411
They didn't have enough
food, they didn't have enough money, they

00:11:11.411 --> 00:11:16.499
didn't have sufficient clothing, and it
actually damaged their body.

00:11:16.499 --> 00:11:19.910
And that damage to their body also damaged
their

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.810
self-esteem.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:31.260
So if it's true I have paid this kindness
to someone else, then by

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:38.720
this act of truth may people like that with
low self-esteem--

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:43.300
may they come to have great spiritual
practice.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:53.519
And Shantideva here includes people who were
born into a society which has

00:11:53.519 --> 00:11:58.889
different levels within that society, and
among those levels they were born into

00:11:58.889 --> 00:12:00.060
the lower levels.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:06.279
And they were taken advantage of, or they
were hurt,

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:12.279
systematically--by the system of their of
their culture and they were kept down.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:22.200
 May those people suddenly find the right and
the position to enjoy a deep

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.199
spiritual practice.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:33.540
And by the way, I will take away the seeds
of bad thoughts,

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:37.760
words, and deeds done by any of these people
in the past okay?

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:42.920
That's similar to taking away illness from
a person.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.480
Illness is what we call
"result suffering".

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:53.440
And the seeds for that are negative--being
negative in how you

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:57.340
speak, how you think, how you act.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:07.459
So may this act of truth also remove suffering
in the form of pain which is about to come.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:12.700
Things which are not pain yet--
pain which is waiting to happen.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:23.120
If I've done this act of truth, may people
show loving conduct to each other.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:28.509
May there be no darkness in their attitude
or their behavior.

00:13:28.509 --> 00:13:33.579
May they be
perfectly innocent, and helpful, and kind

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.460
to each other.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:47.060
May all spiritual practitioners, through my
act of truth, live a long life.

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.500
May they
feel experiences of bliss.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.680
And then,

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:56.360
Shantideva ends this meditation very
sweetly.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.300
May the word "death" disappear from this world.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:13.680
May we come to a time in this
world where nobody knows what the word "virus"

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.720
means,

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:19.080
and nobody remembers what
the word "Covid" means.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:22.340
And no one even remembers what the word "death"
used to

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.480
mean

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.300
because these things are gone.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:32.900
If it's true I have shown some kindness
during this pandemic, then may these things

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.000
come to pass.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.340
Then slowly open
your eyes..

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.100
Take a good stretch.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.100
And we'll do this
meditation for a week

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.240
and then we'll pick

00:15:09.249 --> 00:15:10.360
up with.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.589
Master Shantideva next week.

00:15:12.589 --> 00:15:13.699
Thank you.

00:15:13.699 --> 00:15:14.809
thanks Tim.

00:15:14.809 --> 00:15:15.929
Thanks
Seiji.

